   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "2", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[4]=",
 CellID->822051473,ExpressionUUID->"c80105f0-45d0-4942-a37d-6d69c930782f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Since a cellular automaton on a cyclic tape is an automata network in which \
each cell reads its neighbors, this gives a second way to compile cellular \
automata, and one that also works for other kinds of wiring.\
\>", "TechNoteText",
 CellID->206498190,ExpressionUUID->"22c92ef8-f211-8f4d-9338-1f4ac10366d8"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Rule 110", "TechNoteSection",
 CellID->173401426,ExpressionUUID->"cb5e5c77-e178-ca43-ac9d-d53f3a4b1540"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Matthew Cook's construction emulates cyclic tag systems in rule 110 when \
their number of appendants is a multiple of 6. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<TargetSystem\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Rule110\>\""}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "db32b4c8-58fb-fe4e-ad52-51339f1ad4b5"],
 " rounds the size of every symbol's block up to a multiple of 6, which makes \
the number of appendants a multiple of 6. The compiled functions have the \
option ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Mod6CyclicTag\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "4e6611c0-e56d-474f-a0b4-03fc6e81a34a"],
 " for this:"
}], "TechNoteText",
 CellID->405983159,ExpressionUUID->"8712f4b2-2680-f34f-9776-9db45d824dd7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Length", " ", "/@", " ", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"CellularAutomatonToCyclicTagRule", "[", 
     RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "9"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"CellularAutomatonToCyclicTagRule", "[", 
     RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "9", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<TargetSystem\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Rule110\>\""}]}], 
     "]"}]}], "}"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->389782504,ExpressionUUID->"10836fc1-b017-a548-bca9-e95b3c26894d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"120", ",", "180"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->638848494,ExpressionUUID->"a0a7cc5a-5d01-394d-9caf-c80dc9af34da"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"CompiledCellularAutomatonToCyclicTag", "[", 
    RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "9", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<InfiniteSteps\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Mod6CyclicTag\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}]}], "]"}], "[", 
   
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"CenterArray", "[", "9", "]"}], ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], " ", "===",
   " ", 
  RowBox[{"CellularAutomaton", "[", 
   RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"CenterArray", "[", "9", "]"}], ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[2]:=",
 CellID->305360880,ExpressionUUID->"1b822c89-b16f-ac47-8c92-e7f3ef0b60ae"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[2]=",
 CellID->599077929,ExpressionUUID->"c0395d50-c0da-d64d-9b2c-c932bb8b86f8"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Limitations", "TechNoteSection",
 CellID->646402629,ExpressionUUID->"4a67707e-8c62-ec4f-a92c-4f4d3f06574c"],

Cell["\<\
Only finite systems can be compiled: cellular automata on cyclic tapes of a \
given length, and finite automata networks.\
\>", "Item",
 CellID->51305288,ExpressionUUID->"641a047b-d35b-5240-8a8a-c205f825d419"],

Cell["\<\
Oblivious ring machine steps must replace their window by the same number of \
symbols, read windows of the same size in each step, and only rotate the tape \
forward.\
\>", "Item",
 CellID->485182430,ExpressionUUID->"7e96048b-2ba7-9e4c-8e0b-1216c3a1e457"],

Cell["\<\
Symbols or states that rules compute rather than write explicitly are not \
counted automatically; give the number of symbols or states for such rules.\
\>", "Item",
 CellID->806171566,ExpressionUUID->"b4a9943b-27d9-234d-8d89-0ba990059a9a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
The compiled cyclic tag systems are large, and grow with the tape length, the \
number of colors and the range:\
\>", "Item",
 CellID->63741478,ExpressionUUID->"103275ab-bd03-7541-b817-4c15b479a493"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
    RowBox[{"CellularAutomatonToCyclicTagRule", "[", 
     RowBox[{"110", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"n", ",", " ", "4", ",", " ", "12", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->825897897,ExpressionUUID->"fa028bcd-7e5d-9845-a493-69d0b9daefbd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"80", ",", "96", ",", "112", ",", "128", ",", "144"}], 
  "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->812078781,ExpressionUUID->"5b7b7409-0018-2143-a9ca-9151fc31f3e4"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

